section LoadWeapons
call SSound.LoadSound Weapons/CMDrop2.wav
call SSound.LoadSound Weapons/SonicLoop.wav
call SSound.LoadSound Weapons/SonicBoom.wav
call SSound.LoadSound Weapons/EMILoop.wav
call SSound.LoadSound Weapons/EMIRayo1.wav
call SSound.LoadSound Weapons/EMIRayo2.wav
